  "details": "The in-game microphone icon is unreliable. It lights up even when the microphone volume is at 0%.\nTo reproduce:\n- VRChat 2021.1.2\n- Set microphone volume to 0%\n- Speak\nObserve:\n- Other player will not be able to hear you (working as expected)\n- Red microphone icon still light up (unexpectedly)\n\nRelated canny posts:\nAudio sliders behave oddly and never reach a volume of 0 dB\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/audio-controls-reduce-volume-2x-more-quickly-than-they-should\nMaster volume at 0% is not silent\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/master-volume-0-isnt-always-silent",
